    "intro": {
      "zh": "Donkey Kong 街机框体是任天堂 1981 年推出的经典街机，宫本茂主导开发，玩家操控 Jumpman 攀爬梯子、跳跃躲避滚桶，营救被大金刚劫持的女主角。它是平台跳跃类型的开创之作，也是任天堂标志角色马里奥的前身起点，是街机暗房区「平台跳跃鼻祖」叙事线的核心展品。",
      "en": "The Donkey Kong arcade cabinet, released by Nintendo in 1981 and designed by Shigeru Miyamoto, let players control Jumpman to climb ladders and leap over rolling barrels to rescue the heroine from Donkey Kong. It pioneered the platforming genre and introduced Jumpman, the forerunner of Mario."
    },
    "era": 1981,
    "manufacturer": "Nintendo"
  },
